# Retired per-artifact release skills
# Deleted twice and swept back in twice by `git add -A`. They describe a
# tag-and-push flow that no longer exists; the single .claude/skills/release
# skill is authoritative. Ignored so the mistake cannot recur.
.claude/skills/release-awid-docker/
.claude/skills/release-awid-pypi/
.claude/skills/release-channel/
.claude/skills/release-cli/
.claude/skills/release-pi/
.claude/skills/release-pypi/
